    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>erotic SRPG</strong> where combat and gameplay shape the narrative. The protagonists are a male fighter and his love interest- but other members of your party will try to grope the pair, seducing them over to their side. With proper positioning this can be avoided, but you'll be at a major disadvantage in the battles.\u00a0Will you use all the abilities at your disposal to <strong>crush your enemies</strong>, or will you <strong>hold back</strong> to try and <strong>protect the fragile love of our heroes?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756120/extras/45ad51e802edb97b56a7ec419cf1df7a.avif?t=1745361758\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carwyn</strong> has been <strong>condemned to an almost certain death</strong> and his only hope of survival is a set of trials fraught with danger. He is joined by <strong>the</strong> <strong>love of his life, Gwenivier,</strong> as the two descend into a cavern from which no-one has ever returned. They will encounter obstacles and opponents that will push their relationship to its breaking point. Will true love prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuckolding scenarios involve <strong>three different men trying to win Gwenivier's affections</strong>, a <strong>female rival for Gwenivier</strong> obsessed with Carwyn, and a <strong>male to female transformation for Carwyn</strong> leading to him becoming the groups play thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756120/extras/328463f75765df8f322b9d6fa3bb42d5.avif?t=1745361758\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Netoria Tactics: Revolution Gold features<strong> new art, additional story events, </strong>and<strong> special items </strong>not found in the original release-<strong> with plans for even more content on the horizon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VOYEUR MODE:</strong> Hide cuckold scenes so that you are only aware through hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MECHANICS DRIVEN:</strong> Your choices in combat affect Gwenivier's loyalty to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GENDER BENDING:</strong> Carwyn can be feminized based on the player's actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOLDEN PATH:</strong> There is a &quot;perfect&quot; route and ending, if you're skilled enough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUEST ART:</strong> A number of new, non-canon, scenes and artworks by various artists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
